DGM4-Complex — license terms
============================

Code (everything under scripts/ and any other *.py files in this
repository) is released under the Apache License 2.0 — see
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 .

Dataset contents (everything under samples/, assets/, and the full
dataset bundles referenced in docs/full_dataset_access.md) are
released for **non-commercial research use only**, inheriting the
terms of the upstream datasets:

  - DGM4 / MultiModal-DeepFake
    https://github.com/rshaojimmy/MultiModal-DeepFake
  - Visual News
    https://github.com/FuxiaoLiu/VisualNews-Repository

By downloading, copying, installing, or using any portion of the
DGM4-Complex dataset, you agree:

  1. to use the dataset for non-commercial research purposes only;
  2. to cite the GraDual paper and the original DGM4 paper in any
     resulting publication or artifact;
  3. not to redistribute the base DGM4 images (we do not redistribute
     them either — obtain them from the original DGM4 release);
  4. to respect the Visual News license when using origin images
     or article texts;
  5. to make reasonable efforts to protect the privacy of any
     individuals whose likenesses appear in the dataset.

If you are unsure whether your intended use is permitted, please
contact the authors before proceeding.
